<title>UK: IMI names Trevor Slack finance director.</title>
<headline>IMI names Trevor Slack finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group IMI Plc said on Thursday it named financial controller Trevor Slack to succeed Alan Emson as finance director, effective August 1.</p>
<p>IMI said Emson would retire on July 31. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
